msgstr "没有此文章类型。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:883
msgid "This post type is registered in code and can only be changed there."
msgstr "此文章类型在代码中注册，只能在那里更改。"

#. translators: 1: a post type feature, such as excerpt, 2: a post type's name.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1010
msgid "%1$s is turned on for %2$s outside the settings Minn Admin edits (by the theme, a plugin or a custom supports field), so it cannot be turned off here."
msgstr "%1$s 已在 Minn Admin 编辑的设置之外为 %2$s 开启（由主题、插件或自定义 supports 字段开启），因此无法在此关闭。"

#. translators: 1: a post type feature, such as excerpt, 2: a post type's name.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1020
msgid "%1$s is already on in the settings of %2$s, but the theme or a plugin turns it off, so it cannot be turned on here."
msgstr "%1$s 已在 %2$s 的设置中开启，但主题或插件将其关闭，因此无法在此开启。"

#. translators: 1: a taxonomy's name, 2: a post type's name.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1087
msgid "%1$s is attached to %2$s by the theme or a plugin, not in either one’s settings, so it cannot be detached here."
msgstr "%1$s 是由主题或插件关联到 %2$s 的，并非在两者任一方的设置中关联，因此无法在此解除关联。"

#. translators: 1: a taxonomy's name, 2: a post type's name.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1108
msgid "%1$s is already attached to %2$s in their settings, but the theme or a plugin detaches it, so it cannot be attached here."
msgstr "%1$s 已在两者的设置中关联到 %2$s，但主题或插件解除了该关联，因此无法在此关联。"

#. translators: 1: a taxonomy's name, 2: a post type's name.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1119
msgid "JetEngine keeps a post type’s taxonomies in each taxonomy’s settings, and %1$s is not one you can edit here, so it cannot be attached to %2$s."
msgstr "JetEngine 将文章类型的分类法保存在每个分类法的设置中，而 %1$s 不是您可以在此编辑的分类法，因此无法将其关联到 %2$s。"

#. translators: 1: a taxonomy's name, 2: a post type's name, 3: a plugin's name, such as Custom Post Type UI.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1139
msgid "%1$s is attached to %2$s in %3$s, which this site keeps to people with that plugin’s own access."
msgstr "%1$s 已在 %3$s 中关联到 %2$s，而此站点仅向拥有该插件自身访问权限的人员开放该插件。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1222
#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1465
msgid "ACF definition not found."
msgstr "未找到 ACF 定义。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1241
msgid "This post type is registered in code and can only be removed there."
msgstr "此文章类型在代码中注册，只能在那里移除。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1244
msgid "Definition removed; existing content stays in the database."
msgstr "定义已移除；现有内容仍保留在数据库中。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1340
msgid "Slug is required: lowercase letters, numbers, dashes or underscores, 32 characters max."
msgstr "别名为必填：小写字母、数字、连字符或下划线，最多 32 个字符。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1375
msgid "No such taxonomy."
msgstr "没有此分类法。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1384
msgid "This taxonomy is registered in code and can only be changed there."
msgstr "此分类法在代码中注册，只能在那里更改。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1484
msgid "This taxonomy is registered in code and can only be removed there."
msgstr "此分类法在代码中注册，只能在那里移除。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1487
msgid "Definition removed; existing terms stay in the database."
msgstr "定义已移除；现有分类项仍保留在数据库中。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1529
#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1559
