msgstr "JetEngine 无法移除该定义。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1796
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1825
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1987
msgid "Unknown table."
msgstr "未知表格。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1800
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1829
msgid "Could not read the table structure."
msgstr "无法读取表格结构。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1868
msgid "That column holds passwords or tokens, so it cannot be searched."
msgstr "该列包含密码或令牌，因此无法搜索。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1891
msgid "This site holds too many credentials for Minn to check a value search against, so values cannot be searched here."
msgstr "此站点的凭据过多，Minn 无法对值搜索进行核对，因此无法在此搜索值。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:1993
msgid "This table has no usable primary key."
msgstr "此表格没有可用的主键。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2003
msgid "Row not found."
msgstr "未找到行。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2070
msgid "Not checked"
msgstr "未检查"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2071
msgid "This table is too large to count cheaply, so Minn does not scan it. Run the command below to check it yourself."
msgstr "此表格过大，计数成本过高，因此 Minn 不扫描它。请运行以下命令自行检查。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2145
msgid "Database hygiene"
msgstr "数据库健康检查"

#. translators: %s: number of database checks needing attention.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2151
msgid "%s storage check needs attention"
msgid_plural "%s storage checks need attention"
msgstr[0] "%s 项存储检查需要关注"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2159
msgid "Orphaned rows, indexes and engines all look healthy"
msgstr "孤立行、索引和引擎看起来都正常"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2226
msgid "Tables without a primary key"
msgstr "没有主键的表格"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of database table names.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2233
msgid "These tables have no primary key, which breaks row-level replication and confuses backup and migration tools: %s"
msgstr "这些表格没有主键，这会破坏行级复制并干扰备份和迁移工具：%s"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2236
msgid "Every table has a primary key."
msgstr "每个表格都有主键。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2250
msgid "Storage engine"
msgstr "存储引擎"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of tables and their storage engines.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2257
msgid "These tables do not use InnoDB, so they miss row-level locking and crash recovery: %s"
msgstr "这些表格未使用 InnoDB，因此缺少行级锁定和崩溃恢复：%s"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2260
msgid "Every table uses InnoDB."
msgstr "每个表格都使用 InnoDB。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2262
msgid "Convert a table"
msgstr "转换表格"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2264
msgid "Back up first. Converting locks the table while it runs."
msgstr "请先备份。转换过程中会锁定表格。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2283
msgid "Reclaimable space"
msgstr "可回收空间"

#. translators: 1: table name, 2: reclaimable size (e.g. "82.0 MB").
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2290
msgid "%1$s alone is holding %2$s of free space inside its own file. Optimising rewrites the table and returns it to the disk."
msgstr "仅 %1$s 就在其文件中占用了 %2$s 空闲空间。优化会重写表格并将其归还给磁盘。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2294
msgid "No table is holding a significant amount of reclaimable space."
msgstr "没有表格占用大量可回收空间。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2296
msgid "Optimise tables"
msgstr "优化表格"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2298
msgid "Back up first. Optimising locks each table while it runs."
msgstr "请先备份。优化过程中会锁定每个表格。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2316
msgid "Post meta lookup index"
msgstr "文章 meta 查找索引"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2319
msgid "Present"
msgstr "存在"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2321
msgid "A combined post_id and meta_key index is present, so meta lookups stay fast."
msgstr "已存在 post_id 与 meta_key 的组合索引，因此 meta 查找保持快速。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2322
msgid "Lookups by post and meta key fall back to two separate indexes. On sites with heavy meta use (WooCommerce, event and booking plugins) a combined index is a large, low-risk speed win."
msgstr "按文章和 meta 键查找会回退到两个独立索引。在大量使用 meta 的站点上（WooCommerce、活动与预订插件），组合索引是一项收益大、风险低的加速。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2324
msgid "Add the index"
msgstr "添加索引"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2326
msgid "Back up first. Adding an index locks the table briefly."
msgstr "请先备份。添加索引会短暂锁定表格。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2370
msgid "Auto-increment headroom"
msgstr "自增余量"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2372
msgid "Healthy"
msgstr "健康"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of database table names.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2378
msgid "These tables are within 20 percent of the largest id their column type can store. Once the ceiling is reached, new rows stop being written: %s"
msgstr "这些表格的 ID 已接近其列类型所能存储的最大值的 20% 以内。达到上限后将无法写入新行：%s"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2381
msgid "No table is close to exhausting its id column."
msgstr "没有表格接近用尽其 ID 列。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2389
msgid "Orphaned post meta"
msgstr "孤立的文章 meta"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2392
msgid "These meta rows belong to posts that no longer exist. They are dead weight in every query that touches post meta."
msgstr "这些 meta 行属于已不存在的文章。它们会拖累所有涉及文章 meta 的查询。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2393
msgid "Every meta row belongs to a post that still exists."
msgstr "每条 meta 行都属于仍然存在的文章。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2395
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2413
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2431
msgid "Delete them"
msgstr "删除它们"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2397
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2415
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2433
msgid "Back up first. This permanently deletes rows."
msgstr "请先备份。这将永久删除行。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2407
msgid "Orphaned user meta"
msgstr "孤立的用户 meta"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2410
msgid "These meta rows belong to users who no longer exist, usually left behind by a plugin that removed accounts directly."
msgstr "这些 meta 行属于已不存在的用户，通常由直接删除账户的插件留下。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2411
msgid "Every meta row belongs to a user who still exists."
msgstr "每条 meta 行都属于仍然存在的用户。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2425
msgid "Orphaned term relationships"
msgstr "孤立的分类项关系"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2428
msgid "These rows link content to categories or tags that no longer exist."
msgstr "这些行将内容链接到已不存在的分类或标签。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2429
msgid "Every relationship points at a term that still exists."
msgstr "每个关系都指向仍然存在的分类项。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2443
msgid "Stored revisions"
msgstr "已存储的修订版本"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2446
msgid "Revisions are the editor safety net, so a large number is normal and not a fault. Trimming them is only worthwhile if the posts table has grown unwieldy."
msgstr "修订版本是编辑器的安全网，数量多是正常的，并非故障。仅当文章表变得过于庞大时，精简它们才有价值。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2447
msgid "No revisions are stored."
msgstr "未存储修订版本。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2449
msgid "Delete all revisions"
msgstr "删除全部修订版本"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2451
msgid "Back up first. This removes every saved revision permanently."
msgstr "请先备份。这将永久移除所有已保存的修订版本。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2461
msgid "Spam and trashed comments"
msgstr "垃圾和回收站中的评论"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2464
msgid "Spam and trashed comments stay in the database until they are emptied. WordPress clears them on its own after a while."
msgstr "垃圾和回收站中的评论会保留在数据库中，直到被清空。WordPress 稍后会自行清理它们。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2465
msgid "No spam or trashed comments are waiting."
msgstr "没有等待处理的垃圾或回收站评论。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2467
msgid "Delete spam"
msgstr "删除垃圾"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2469
msgid "Back up first. This permanently deletes the comments."
msgstr "请先备份。这将永久删除这些评论。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2480
msgid "Expired WooCommerce sessions"
msgstr "已过期的 WooCommerce 会话"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2483
msgid "Expired cart sessions should be cleared by a scheduled WooCommerce job. A large backlog usually means that job has stopped running."
msgstr "已过期的购物车会话应由计划的 WooCommerce 任务清理。积压过多通常意味着该任务已停止运行。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2484
msgid "No expired sessions are left behind."
msgstr "没有残留的过期会话。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2486
msgid "Delete expired sessions"
msgstr "删除已过期会话"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2488
msgid "Back up first. Shoppers with an expired cart lose it, which has already happened by definition."
msgstr "请先备份。购物车已过期的顾客会丢失购物车，而这本来就已经发生了。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2499
msgid "Action Scheduler backlog"
msgstr "Action Scheduler 积压"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2502
msgid "Pending and failed background jobs. A steady backlog is normal on a busy store; a very large one suggests the queue is not draining."
msgstr "待审和失败的后台任务。在繁忙商店上持续积压是正常的；积压过大则说明队列未能排空。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2503
msgid "No pending or failed background jobs."
msgstr "没有待审或失败的后台任务。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2505
msgid "Clean the queue"
msgstr "清理队列"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:2507
msgid "Removes finished actions. Pending work is left alone."
msgstr "移除已完成的操作。待审工作不受影响。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-egress.php:125
msgid "Part of this change was not saved: it moves or changes a hidden key, shown as [redacted:…]. Type the real value instead."
msgstr "此更改的一部分未保存：它移动或更改了一个隐藏的密钥（显示为 [redacted:…]）。请改为输入真实值。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-egress.php:525
msgid "Nothing was saved: this change holds a hidden key, shown as [redacted:…], and saving it would put that placeholder where the key was. Type the real value in its place, or leave that part as it was."
msgstr "未保存任何内容：此更改包含一个隐藏的密钥（显示为 [redacted:…]），保存后会把该占位符放到原密钥的位置。请在该处输入真实值，或保持该部分原样。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-egress.php:544
msgid "This holds a saved key (an API or licence key), and Minn never hands one out, so the export file was not made: it would not import correctly without the key."
msgstr "此项包含已保存的密钥（API 密钥或许可证密钥），而 Minn 从不提供任何密钥，因此未生成导出文件：缺少密钥将无法正确导入。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-fences.php:202
msgid "Part of this change was not saved: it would have changed who can run this site, which your account can’t do."
msgstr "此更改有一部分未保存：它会改变谁可以运行此站点，而您的账户无法这样做。"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-logs.php:93
msgid "PHP error log"
msgstr "PHP 错误日志"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-logs.php:93
#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:13807
msgid "Server"
msgstr "服务器"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-logs.php:175
#: includes/class-minn-admin-logs.php:200
msgid "Unknown log source."
